    "@value" : "Referenced Ontology: Drinking = Drinking Behavior (ATOL:0000361) \"any measurable or observable characteristic related to the consumption of liquids ressources such as water or milk\" (Meunier-Salaün et. al,2015)\nunder: Animal trait of livestock ->pyschroneuroendocrinological state trait->ingestive behaviour->drinking behavior"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@value" : "Drinking"
  } ],
