    "@value" : "Referenced Ontology:\n1.Movement is a behaviour\n3.Different behaviour states may be observed based  on Movement rate, distance covered and  Geopositions.\nReference:\nMovement = Member movement (ATOL:000842) (Meunier-Salaün et. al,2015)\nUnder Behavior trait->Motor activity->body movement->member movement behavior."
