    "@value" : "Referenced Ontology:\nPanting = Panting(ATOL:00832)\n\"any measurable or observable characteristic related to the ability of increasing breathing by polypnea or hyperpnea performed with open mouth and distinct thoracic movements, to increase O2-CO2 exchanges and/or to increase evaporative heat loss.\" (Meunier-Salaün et. al,2015)"
