    "@value" : "Referenced Ontology:\n1.Running is a behaviour = running behavior(ATOL:0000806), \"any measurable or observable characteristic related to rapidely coordinated displacement of the body on foot or limbs\"  (Meunier-Salaün et. al,2015)\n2.Running can have normal or abnomal behaviour state based on the livestock speed and running duration.\n\nAOL Under: Animal trait of livestock->animal welfar trait->psychoneuroendocrinological state trait->motor activity->locomotor activity->running behaviour"
  } ],
