  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "Referenced Ontology:\n1. Startle is a Behaviour = startle reponses(ATOL:0000368), \"any measurable or observable characteristic related to the response of the whole body to triggering stimulus without any voluntary orientation towards this given stimulus\"\n\nIn ATOL under:Aninmal trait of livestock->animal welfare trait->psychoneuroendcrinological state trait->behavior trait->motor activity->body movement->locomotor activity->startle response"
  } ],
